Third-party design references

The local investigation design was informed by Compex Fraud Desk (Apache-2.0),
including evidence-ID grounding, coded decisions, bounded retry budgets, cautious
policy, a written playbook and offline replay.
https://github.com/CompexTo/fraud-desk/tree/1129a15bfee7476d8d109f9437595f95edb25615

Tazama (Apache-2.0) informed the rule / weighted-typology / threshold architecture.
https://github.com/tazama-lf/docs

IBM AMLSim (Apache-2.0) informed cycle, fan-in and gather/scatter vocabulary.
https://github.com/IBM/AMLSim

These projects are external references; their separate results are not Satstride
measurements. Compex Credit Desk and the Compex platform are separate projects.
Their source is not copied into this snapshot.

